    {
      "id": "week-01",
      "label": "Week 1",
      "title": "Meeting your patient for the first time",
      "shortTitle": "환자와의 첫 만남",
      "description": "첫인사부터 호칭 확인, 세션 안내까지. 환자가 편안하게 대화를 시작할 수 있도록 연습해요.",
      "scenario": "허리 통증으로 처음 내원한 John Thompson. 물리치료사 Alex가 환자를 맞이하고 오늘의 진행 과정을 안내합니다.",
      "audio": null,
      "expressions": [
        "Is it okay if I call you John?",
        "How was your trip here today?",
        "Does that sound okay?"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "Hi, are you John Thompson?",
          "ko": "안녕하세요, John Thompson 씨 맞으신가요?",
          "turn": 1,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/natural-tail/female/01.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/male/01.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "I'm Alex, I'll be your physiotherapist today.",
          "ko": "저는 Alex이고, 오늘 담당 물리치료사입니다.",
          "turn": 1,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/natural-tail/female/02.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/male/02.m4a"
          },
          "segments": {
            "female": {
              "start": 1.29,
              "end": 4.01
            },
            "male": {
              "start": 1.95,
              "end": 5.08
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "Yes, that's right.",
          "ko": "네, 맞아요.",
          "audio": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/patient/03.m4a",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 0.98
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "Nice to meet you, John.",
          "ko": "만나서 반갑습니다, John.",
          "turn": 2,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/natural-tail/female/04.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/male/04.m4a"
          },
          "segments": {
            "female": {
              "start": 4.01,
              "end": 5.65
            },
            "male": {
              "start": 5.08,
              "end": 6.7
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "Is it okay if I call you John, or would you prefer Mr Thompson?",
          "ko": "John이라고 불러도 괜찮을까요, 아니면 Thompson 씨라고 불러드릴까요?",
          "turn": 2,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/natural-tail/female/05.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/male/05.m4a"
          },
          "segments": {
            "female": {
              "start": 5.65,
              "end": 9.27
            },
            "male": {
              "start": 6.7,
              "end": 10.63
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "John is fine, thanks.",
          "ko": "John이라고 불러주시면 돼요. 감사합니다.",
          "audio": "audio/week-01/end-fix/patient/06.m4a",
          "start": 0.98,
          "end": 2.28
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "Great, thanks, John.",
          "ko": "좋아요, 감사합니다, John.",
          "turn": 3,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/natural-tail/female/07.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/male/07.m4a"
          },
          "segments": {
            "female": {
              "start": 9.27,
              "end": 11.26
            },
            "male": {
              "start": 10.63,
              "end": 12.58
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "How was your trip here today?",
          "ko": "오늘 여기까지 오시는 길은 어떠셨어요?",
          "turn": 3,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/natural-tail/female/08.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/male/08.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "Not too bad. I found parking quite easily.",
          "ko": "괜찮았어요. 주차도 꽤 쉽게 했고요.",
          "audio": "audio/week-01/end-fix/patient/09.m4a",
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 4.75
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "Good to hear. So today I'll ask you a few questions about your back,",
          "ko": "다행이네요. 오늘은 허리에 대해 몇 가지 질문을 드리고,",
          "turn": 4,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/end-fix/female/10.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/end-fix/male/10.m4a"
          },
          "segments": {
            "female": {
              "start": 13.7,
              "end": 18.58
            },
            "male": {
              "start": 14.32,
              "end": 18.54
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "and then see how your back moves.",
          "ko": "그다음 허리가 어떻게 움직이는지 살펴볼 거예요.",
          "turn": 4,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/natural-tail/female/11.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/male/11.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "Does that sound okay?",
          "ko": "괜찮으실까요?",
          "turn": 4,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/natural-tail/female/12.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/male/12.m4a"
          },
          "segments": {
            "female": {
              "start": 20.53,
              "end": 22.29
            },
            "male": {
              "start": 20.93,
              "end": 22.64
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "Yes, that sounds fine.",
          "ko": "네, 좋아요.",
          "audio": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/patient/13.m4a",
          "start": 4.75,
          "end": 6.51
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "Great. Before we start,",
          "ko": "좋습니다. 시작하기 전에,",
          "turn": 5,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/end-fix/female/14.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/end-fix/male/14.m4a"
          },
          "segments": {
            "female": {
              "start": 22.29,
              "end": 24.31
            },
            "male": {
              "start": 22.64,
              "end": 25.13
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "is there anything you'd like to ask me?",
          "ko": "저에게 물어보고 싶은 게 있으세요?",
          "turn": 5,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-01/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/end-fix/female/15.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/male/15.m4a"
          },
          "segments": {
            "female": {
              "start": 24.31,
              "end": 26.645
            },
            "male": {
              "start": 25.13,
              "end": 27.246
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "No, I think that's everything.",
          "ko": "아뇨, 더는 없는 것 같아요.",
          "audio": "audio/week-01/natural-tail/patient/16.m4a",
          "start": 6.51,
