    {
      "id": "week-02",
      "label": "Week 2",
      "title": "Setting goals with your patient",
      "shortTitle": "목표 정하기",
      "description": "먼저 눈으로 읽으며 의미를 이해한 뒤, 소리 내어 읽어 보세요. 명확하고 자연스러운 속도에 집중하세요.",
      "scenario": "John says he wants to sit more comfortably at work, sleep better and return to his usual walks. He is unsure which goal to focus on first.",
      "audio": null,
      "expressions": [
        "What would you most like to get back to doing?",
        "Is that another priority for you?",
        "That sounds like a good place to start."
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "John, what would you most like to get back to doing?",
          "ko": "John, 어떤 활동을 가장 다시 하고 싶으세요?",
          "turn": 1,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-02/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/2026-10-31-v1/female/01.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/male/01.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "I'd like to sit at work without constantly having to change positions.",
          "ko": "직장에서 계속 자세를 바꾸지 않고 앉아 있고 싶어요.",
          "turn": 2,
          "audio": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/patient/02.m4a"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "How long do you usually need to sit for at work?",
          "ko": "직장에서는 보통 얼마나 오래 앉아 계셔야 하나요?",
          "turn": 3,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-02/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/2026-10-31-v1/female/03.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/male/03.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "Sometimes I have meetings that last about half an hour.",
          "ko": "가끔 30분 정도 이어지는 회의가 있어요.",
          "turn": 4,
          "audio": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/patient/04.m4a"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "So sitting through a 30-minute meeting more comfortably would be useful?",
          "ko": "그러면 30분 회의 동안 좀 더 편하게 앉아 있을 수 있으면 도움이 되겠네요?",
          "turn": 5,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-02/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/2026-10-31-v1/female/05.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/male/05.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "Yes, definitely.",
          "ko": "네, 정말요.",
          "turn": 6,
          "audio": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/patient/06.m4a"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "You also mentioned wanting to get back to running.",
          "ko": "달리기도 다시 하고 싶다고 하셨죠.",
          "turn": 7,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-02/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/2026-10-31-v1/female/07.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/male/07.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "Is that another priority for you?",
          "ko": "그것도 중요하게 생각하시는 목표인가요?",
          "turn": 7,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-02/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/2026-10-31-v1/female/08.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/male/08.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "Yes, I'd really like to run again,",
          "ko": "네, 정말 다시 달리고 싶어요.",
          "turn": 8,
          "audio": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/patient/09.m4a"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "but sitting at work is the main problem at the moment.",
          "ko": "하지만 지금은 직장에서 앉아 있는 게 가장 큰 문제예요.",
          "turn": 8,
          "audio": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/patient/10.m4a"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "That makes sense.",
          "ko": "그렇군요.",
          "turn": 9,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-02/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/2026-10-31-v1/female/11.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/male/11.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "Shall we start with the meeting goal as a short-term goal",
          "ko": "회의 때 편하게 앉아 있는 것을 단기 목표로 먼저 삼고,",
          "turn": 9,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-02/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/2026-10-31-v1/female/12.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/male/12.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "en": "and work towards getting you back to running over time?",
          "ko": "시간을 두고 다시 달릴 수 있도록 함께해 볼까요?",
          "turn": 9,
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-02/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/2026-10-31-v1/female/13.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/male/13.m4a"
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Patient",
          "en": "Yes, that sounds like a good place to start.",
          "ko": "네, 거기서부터 시작하면 좋겠어요.",
          "turn": 10,
          "audio": "audio/week-02/2026-10-31-v1/patient/14.m4a"
        }
      ],
