        {
          "speaker": "Physio",
          "turn": 3,
          "en": "Okay. Whereabouts in your back do you feel it?",
          "ko": "그렇군요. 허리 어느 부위가 아프세요?",
          "audioVoices": {
            "female": "audio/week-03/volume-balanced-2026-11-09/2026-11-09-v1/female/03.m4a",
            "male": "audio/week-03/2026-11-09-v1/male/03.m4a"
